{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t兩名香港搖搖選手早前在日本舉行的世界搖搖大賽，雙手迴旋花式組別包辦頭兩名。<br/>\n<br/>\n奪得冠軍的陳俊熙接受本台節目訪問指，很多世界冠軍級選手都是用香港品牌出產的搖搖，期望未來可以推動更多人在香港參與這項運動。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.700458+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:38:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:38:24.739682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.493241+00:00","content_hash":"4acc4d907c02e2fcfd74c392f709f82dd2c4e89f0cb5d8294257c7dc55fe01fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}